  "body": "Currently the physical web is said to transmit a URL. Would it make sense to transmit JSON instead with a start_url as defined in http://w3c.github.io/manifest/ ? That way we can get a more web app like experience. Another option would be to transmit the URL referring to a manifest.\n\n@marcoscaceres @anssik @jyasskin \n",
